<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lake_ruin">><<set $bus to "lake_ruin_deep">><<underwater>><<effects>><<lakeeffects>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<passoutlake>>
<<elseif $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
	<<orgasmLocation "underwater">>

	<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
	<br>
	<<swimicon "back">><<link [[Swim towards exit|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
	<br><br>
	<<plinthroom>>
<<elseif $foresthunt gte 10>>
	<<foresthunt>>
<<else>>
	<<cleareventpool>>
	<<addinlineevent "ivory box" 20>>
		<<wearProp "antique ivory box">>
		You reach inside one of the pots, and find a small ivory box. It's sealed by a bronze lock.
		<br><br>
		<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
			The box itself is very old. It must be valuable.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
		<<lockicon "unlock">><<link [[Open it|Lake Ruin Box]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<loxygen>>
		<br>
		<<if $historytrait gte 4>>
			<<antiqueicon "ivory-box">><<link [[Just take the box|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><<set $antiquemoney += 10>><<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquebox" "found">><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
		<br>
		<<swimicon "up">><<link [[Swim towards exit|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
		<br><br>
		<<plinthroom>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent "swarm" 2>>
		You reach inside one of the pots. Swarms of small fish surge out, surrounding you.
		<br><br>
		<<if $settings.swarmsEnabled>>
			<<link [[Next|Lake Swarm]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<outfitChecks>>
			<<if !_fullyNaked>>
				<<if _outfit and (_top === _bottom)>>
					<<set _bottom to $worn[Object.keys(_top.outfitPrimary).filter((key)=>key.includes("lower"))?.[0]]>>
				<</if>>
				<<if _bottom>><<set _bottom.integrity -= 10>><</if>>
				<<if _top>><<set _top.integrity -= 10>><</if>>
				<<integritycheck>><<exposure>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			You manage to swim away from the swarms of fish who stay near their pots<<if !_fullyNaked>>, but your clothing is left worse for wear<</if>>.
			<<trauma 12>><<stress 24>><<gtrauma>><<ggstress>>
			<br><br>
			<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<handheldon>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br>
			<<swimicon "up">><<link [[Swim towards exit|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><<handheldon>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br><br>
			<<plinthroom>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<if $lakeRuin.goldchastityfound>>
		<<addinlineevent "divers" 4>>
			<<generate1>><<person1>><<npcClothesType $NPCList[0] "beachDive">>
			<<generate2>><<person2>><<npcClothesType $NPCList[1] "beachDive">>
			You reach inside one of the pots when you notice a pair of divers not far away, a <<person1>><<person>> and a <<person2>><<person>>. The <<person1>><<person>> is rummaging through the pots on the lakebed, busy with the same activity as you. They must have heard about the riches hidden near the ruins.
			<br><br>
			The <<person2>><<person>> points at you and they start to swim in your direction, anger in their eyes.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Swim away|Lake Depths Divers]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<tiredness 6>><</link>><<ggtiredness>><<swimmingdifficulty 500 1500>>
			<br>
			<<if $submissive lte 500>>
				<<link [[Threaten them|Lake Depths Divers]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
			<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $submissive gte 1500>>
				<<link [[Appease them|Lake Depths Divers]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>><<difficulty 75>>
			<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
				<<link [[Seduce|Lake Depths Divers]]>><<set $phase to 4>><</link>><<promiscuous4>><<difficulty `Math.round(($attractiveness + (currentSkillValue("seductionskill") * 10))/300)`>>
			<br>
			<</if>>
			<<link [[Wait|Lake Depths Divers]]>><<set $phase to 5>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
	<<addinlineevent "dust" 27>>
		You reach inside one of the pots. There's purple dust at the bottom. Your probing disturbs it, and it swirls around your arm. You feel heated.
		<<gstress>><<stress 3>><<garousal>><<arousal 600>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
			<<orgasmLocation "underwater">>

			<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br>
			<<swimicon "up">><<link [[Swim towards exit|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br><br>
			<<plinthroom>>
		<<else>>
			<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br>
			<<swimicon "up">><<link [[Swim towards exit|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br><br>
			<<plinthroom>>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<if !$lakeRuin.key>>
		<<addinlineevent "bronze key" 10>>
			<<wearProp "key" "bronze">>
			You reach inside one of the pots. You find a decaying bronze key.
			<<set $lakeRuin.key to 1>>
			<br><br>
			<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br>
			<<swimicon "up">><<link [[Swim towards exit|Lake Ruin]]>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
			<br><br>
			<<plinthroom>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
	<<addinlineevent "empty" 40>>
		<<rng>>
		<<if $rng gte 81>>
			You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of broken ceramics.
		<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
			You reach inside one of the pots. Something inside snaps at you. You pull your hand away in time, but it was close.
			<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
		<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
			You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of mud.
		<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
			<<wearProp "rock">>
			You reach inside one of the pots. It's full of pebbles.
		<<else>>
			You reach inside one of the pots. It's empty.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<lakeicon "pots">><<link [[Search pots (0:01)|Lake Pots]]>><<pass 1>><<tiredness 1>><<wateraction>><</link>><<loxygen>>
