	<<tearful>> you escape the swarms of <<if $settings.slimesEnabled and Time.isBloodMoon()>>pale slimes<<else>>fish<</if>>. They don't pursue.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Lake Depths]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
:: Lake Depths Divers

