		<</if>>
		<<unset $swimmingSuccess>>
	<<case 2>>
		<<if random(1,3) lte 2>>
			You stand your ground, trying to look as intimidating as possible<<if $bodysize gt 2>> by making full use of your large size<<elseif $bodysize lt 2>> despite your smaller stature<</if>>.
