			<<link [[Next|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			You try to look intimidating, <<if $bodysize gt 2>>but even your large size doesn't deter them<<elseif $bodysize lt 2>>but your small size works against you<<else>>but it clearly isn't working<</if>>. They don't hesitate and quickly close the distance.
			<br><br>
