			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Lake Depths Divers Sex]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<case 3>>
		<<if random(1,4) lte 3>>
			You curl up and make yourself look as non-threatening as possible<<if $bodysize gt 2>> despite your large frame<<elseif $bodysize lt 2>>, shrinking even smaller than usual<</if>>.
			<br><br>
